{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play games of Russian roulette with a major strategic component; you can load your own bullets. Choose bullets that can damage, protect, heal, and more. Between rounds, plan and prepare your approach by buying bullets or items that could help you later. Use your progress to unlock buffs for your subsequent runs and try your best to make it as far as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fire Bullets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fire bullets at yourself and take a risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500250/extras/fire-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1740857574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pass Bullets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pass to skip the bullet entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500250/extras/pass-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1740857574\" />Hand Over Bullets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand over to make your opponent take the bullet; but beware it may backfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500250/extras/handOver-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1740857574\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3500250?t=1740857574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3500250?t=1740857574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500250/34b83552a611a3eb0ca89b0e3f8ce2bf2f39f7ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740857574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500250/34b83552a611a3eb0ca89b0e3f8ce2bf2f39f7ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740857574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"